/backups/
backups/
*.sql.gz
data/

# Service-check calibration captures. A saved page can carry the account name
# and conversation content of whoever took it, and these land in the repo root
# by default - so they are ignored rather than left to be swept in by a
# `git add -A`. Keep them outside the repo if you need them long-term.
/*.html
/*.html.json
